{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.86.74.91","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77972,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f909ce6e965dc19017672e27410d1078","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have been to HRH hotels before but not this one. My friend had a wedding at the Punta Cana location and loved it and the service. She had the audio iPod set up and had a dj do a mix for her to play. I don&#039;t know one so i didn&#039;t look as much into it. I&#039;m doing the hacienda beach and the ballroom for the reception&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1876629,"PostDate":1414012297,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have been to HRH hotels before but not this one. My friend had a wedding at the Punta Cana location and loved it and the service. She had the audio iPod set up and had a dj do a mix for her to play. I don't know one so i didn't look as much into it. I'm doing the hacienda beach and the ballroom for the reception<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cintronnoelia@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.70.107.97","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410140645,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279729.jpg?_r=1432171478","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Noelia","Id":279729,"Name":"Noelia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"2.216.154.248","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77972,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"95590909d9ec792f7efc0aab0727c00d","RawContent":"We are going to get married at the kioske chichen and then have reception at one of the terraces. Its a shame you can only have the buffet option for outdoor receptions though.","Attachments":[],"Id":1876641,"PostDate":1414015393,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are going to get married at the kioske chichen and then have reception at one of the terraces. Its a shame you can only have the buffet option for outdoor receptions though. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lizzieh83@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"5.65.218.35","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412706195,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280348.jpg?_r=1428633851","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":112,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"LizzieH","Id":280348,"Name":"LizzieH","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.153.160.175","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77972,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1414022555,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d83ea9dcb151e0a4b35d790059509080","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I saw this post and probably I can help showing this post&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.luckiephotography.com\/hard-rock-riviera-maya-wedding-photography-erikaraul\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.luckiephotography.com\/hard-rock-riviera-maya-wedding-photography-erikaraul\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;the wedding was catholic in the church in front of the beach during the night, reception besides the pool in the right side of the property facing forward towards the ocean then reception ended in the discotheque, I loved it specially because It has a pool in the middle of it!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you PM me I can help if needed!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.luckiephotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/10\/Erika-Raul-Hard-Rock-Riviera-maya-wedding-photographer-Ivan-Luckie-Photography-42.jpg\" alt=\"Erika-Raul-Hard-Rock-Riviera-maya-weddin\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Cheers!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Ivan!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1876654,"PostDate":1414022443,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I saw this post and probably I can help showing this post<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.luckiephotography.com\/hard-rock-riviera-maya-wedding-photography-erikaraul\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.luckiepho...aphy-erikaraul\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>the wedding was catholic in the church in front of the beach during the night, reception besides the pool in the right side of the property facing forward towards the ocean then reception ended in the discotheque, I loved it specially because It has a pool in the middle of it!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you PM me I can help if needed!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.luckiephotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/10\/Erika-Raul-Hard-Rock-Riviera-maya-wedding-photographer-Ivan-Luckie-Photography-42.jpg\" alt=\"Erika-Raul-Hard-Rock-Riviera-maya-weddin\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Cheers!<\/p>\n<p>Ivan!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"iluckie@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"187.153.177.200","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1302206495,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238636.jpg?_r=1389586310","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"IvanLuckiePhotography","Id":238636,"Name":"IvanLuckiePhotography","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.149.50.160","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77972,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"64576317f8a057c0b87be8514da403e6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Ladies&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This wedding took place @HRRM and it was full of magic moments, moments that will be unforgettable&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;https:\/\/vimeo.com\/109830496&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1876843,"PostDate":1414168072,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Ladies<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This wedding took place @HRRM and it was full of magic moments, moments that will be unforgettable<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><iframe src=\"https:\/\/player.vimeo.com\/video\/109830496\" class=\"EmbeddedVideo\" width=\"400\" height=\"250\" frameborder=\"0\"><\/iframe><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mike@cancunweddingvideo.com","IpAddress":"189.149.44.30","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1198791064,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208060.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mikecantarell","Id":208060,"Name":"Mikecantarell","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.86.74.91","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77972,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9bb5c43dbf98c1ef44b2017eaf28f6e7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Love the photos and video can&#039;t wait for my wedding!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"LizzieH\"] Yes i know thats what kept us switching back and forth between the solarium and the ballroom, but since we were paying for dj thought to just take the ballroom.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877106,"PostDate":1414473062,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Love the photos and video can't wait for my wedding!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280348\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/280348-lizzieh\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">LizzieH<\/span><\/a> Yes i know thats what kept us switching back and forth between the solarium and the ballroom, but since we were paying for dj thought to just take the ballroom.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cintronnoelia@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.70.107.97","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410140645,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279729.jpg?_r=1432171478","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Noelia","Id":279729,"Name":"Noelia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.17.228.244","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77972,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1420605370,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"beef85ce33f324ef989f355a04786c71","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi we are planning on going to see this resort on our site visits in February. &amp;nbsp;We are tossed up on 3 resorts. &amp;nbsp;Dreams Tulum which is our first choice. &amp;nbsp;HRH Riveria and Azul Fives and\/or Sensotori.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is so crazy.. you don&#039;t want to make the wrong decision. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877735,"PostDate":1415147701,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi we are planning on going to see this resort on our site visits in February. \u00a0We are tossed up on 3 resorts. \u00a0Dreams Tulum which is our first choice. \u00a0HRH Riveria and Azul Fives and\/or Sensotori.<\/p>\n<p>This is so crazy.. you don't want to make the wrong decision. \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Gian-Luigi & Susan September 13, 2015 Finest Resort <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.finestresorts.com\/special-offers\/?gclid=COnnlrKb_sMCFQeUfgodpEAA-A'>http:\/\/www.finestresorts.com\/special-offers\/?gclid=COnnlrKb_sMCFQeUfgodpEAA-A<\/a>","Email":"susanlaurelli@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"47.17.228.244","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1414858204,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280946.jpg?_r=1435774421","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"SusanMarie813","Id":280946,"Name":"SusanMarie813","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77972,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"17562a1e59db021effd70e18105f1686","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am getting married at Moon Palace. The outside vendor fee is 800. I booked DJ Discomovil. Even with the fee, he is still cheaper than the resort DJ. Palace used PSAV and JSAV&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877777,"PostDate":1415212640,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am getting married at Moon Palace. The outside vendor fee is 800. I booked DJ Discomovil. Even with the fee, he is still cheaper than the resort DJ. Palace used PSAV and JSAV<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"So far 41 guests + bride and groom + 10 kids = 95 room nights.    Focused on planning without stressing.","Email":"bush.chanel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401302870,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TheBHolders","Id":278146,"Name":"TheBHolders","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"94.3.92.47","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77972,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f0d676e172b06ce88e9f8d27cbe032f4","RawContent":"[quote name=\"TheBHolders\" post=\"1877777\" timestamp=\"1415212640\"]\nI am getting married at Moon Palace. The outside vendor fee is 800. I booked DJ Discomovil. Even with the fee, he is still cheaper than the resort DJ. Palace used PSAV and JSAV[\/quote]\nHi how much did discomovil quote you for 4 hours?x","Attachments":[],"Id":1877813,"PostDate":1415234684,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TheBHolders, on 05 November 2014 - 10:37 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I am getting married at Moon Palace. The outside vendor fee is 800. I booked DJ Discomovil. Even with the fee, he is still cheaper than the resort DJ. Palace used PSAV and JSAV<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nHi how much did discomovil quote you for 4 hours?x \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lizzieh83@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"5.65.218.35","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412706195,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280348.jpg?_r=1428633851","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":112,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"LizzieH","Id":280348,"Name":"LizzieH","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.86.74.91","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77972,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1420605350,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7d00686df8c4a5b1eb8e0338fd8d2f7b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"SusanMarie813\" post=\"1877735\" timestamp=\"1415147701\"]\nHi we are planning on going to see this resort on our site visits in February.  We are tossed up on 3 resorts.  Dreams Tulum which is our first choice.  HRH Riveria and Azul Fives and\/or Sensotori.\nThis is so crazy.. you don&#039;t want to make the wrong decision.  \n\n@[member=\"Noelia\"][\/quote] I loved it takes a lot of the hassle away with guests booking their rooms. Also allows everyone to use a payment plan instead of paying up front.","Attachments":[],"Id":1877888,"PostDate":1415318295,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>SusanMarie813, on 04 November 2014 - 04:35 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi we are planning on going to see this resort on our site visits in February. \u00a0We are tossed up on 3 resorts. \u00a0Dreams Tulum which is our first choice. \u00a0HRH Riveria and Azul Fives and\/or Sensotori.<\/p>\n<p>This is so crazy.. you don't want to make the wrong decision. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279729\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279729-noelia\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Noelia<\/span><\/a>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0I loved it takes a lot of the hassle away with guests booking their rooms. Also allows everyone to use a payment plan instead of paying up front.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cintronnoelia@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.70.107.97","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410140645,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279729.jpg?_r=1432171478","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Noelia","Id":279729,"Name":"Noelia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.17.228.244","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77972,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0a283d27bbccac675599ec0809d78a32","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Does anyone have or seen a budget planner for this resort? &amp;nbsp;I have one for Dreams someone shared. &amp;nbsp;Very helpful to look at.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877889,"PostDate":1415320403,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Does anyone have or seen a budget planner for this resort? \u00a0I have one for Dreams someone shared. \u00a0Very helpful to look at.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Gian-Luigi & Susan September 13, 2015 Finest Resort <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.finestresorts.com\/special-offers\/?gclid=COnnlrKb_sMCFQeUfgodpEAA-A'>http:\/\/www.finestresorts.com\/special-offers\/?gclid=COnnlrKb_sMCFQeUfgodpEAA-A<\/a>","Email":"susanlaurelli@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"47.17.228.244","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1414858204,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280946.jpg?_r=1435774421","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"SusanMarie813","Id":280946,"Name":"SusanMarie813","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":35,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
