{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.57.30.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77972,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1420605327,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1e217fc73a52c85369d9b3ca0f291556","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi All,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are getting married there on 10\/17\/15.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have a call with Janeesa on 11\/11 to get the details worked out so I will post again about our talk.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The resort seems like it has something for everyone; even children.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Please post pictures of your experiences.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877954,"PostDate":1415390787,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi All,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are getting married there on 10\/17\/15.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have a call with Janeesa on 11\/11 to get the details worked out so I will post again about our talk.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The resort seems like it has something for everyone; even children.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Please post pictures of your experiences.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"barbara.g.riley@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.53.5.243","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410617785,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279813.jpg?_r=1410618363","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"brye858","Id":279813,"Name":"brye858","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.101.83.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77972,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a7402ee222d42415fba5e03eae95689d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Mikecantarell\" post=\"1876843\" timestamp=\"1414168072\"]\nHello Ladies\n\nThis wedding took place @HRRM and it was full of magic moments, moments that will be unforgettable\n\n[url=\"https:\/\/vimeo.com\/109830496\"]https:\/\/vimeo.com\/109830496[\/url][\/quote]\nHi. I was wondering if you could tell me what that beautiful song is being sung in Spanish right at the beginning of this video? I love it! Spanish is such a romantic language, and that song just gives you goosebumps!","Attachments":[],"Id":1878056,"PostDate":1415567817,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Mikecantarell, on 24 October 2014 - 08:27 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello Ladies<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This wedding took place @HRRM and it was full of magic moments, moments that will be unforgettable<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><iframe src=\"https:\/\/player.vimeo.com\/video\/109830496\" class=\"EmbeddedVideo\" width=\"400\" height=\"250\" frameborder=\"0\"><\/iframe><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hi. I was wondering if you could tell me what that beautiful song is being sung in Spanish right at the beginning of this video? I love it! Spanish is such a romantic language, and that song just gives you goosebumps!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"177.237.101.85","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77972,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ef0913b10d6b162f48ebe6e532b5a1ab","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Hard Rock planners! We recently shot a fabulous &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/destination-wedding-hard-rock-riviera-maya-ss-09182014\/&#039;&gt;wedding at Hard Rock Riviera Maya&lt;\/a&gt;, it really is a fantastic venue and we are looking forward to many more rock n roll brides and grooms. The resort is chic and hip and the wedding coordination team does a bang up job. Here&#039;s a taste of the venue:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79018-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_16186.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17897_16186.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79019-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_134259.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17897_134259.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79020-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_73209.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17897_73209.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79021-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_176575.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17897_176575.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79022-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_32581.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17897_32581.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79023-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_123549.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17897_123549.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79024-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_35171.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17897_35171.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Let us know how the planning is going and if we can be of any assistance! Rock on chicas.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878187,"PostDate":1415732946,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Hard Rock planners! We recently shot a fabulous <a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/destination-wedding-hard-rock-riviera-maya-ss-09182014\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>wedding at Hard Rock Riviera Maya<\/a>, it really is a fantastic venue and we are looking forward to many more rock n roll brides and grooms. The resort is chic and hip and the wedding coordination team does a bang up job. Here's a taste of the venue:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79018-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_16186.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17897_16186.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79019-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_134259.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17897_134259.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79020-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_73209.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17897_73209.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79021-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_176575.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17897_176575.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79022-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_32581.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17897_32581.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79023-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_123549.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17897_123549.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79024-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_35171.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17897_35171.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Let us know how the planning is going and if we can be of any assistance! Rock on chicas.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@delsolphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.144.61","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1175019240,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207303.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Matt Adcock","Id":207303,"Name":"Matt Adcock","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"90.197.26.192","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77972,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8261ebf87b841a6f6d4684bbfe2e3c4a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Matt Adcock\" post=\"1878187\" timestamp=\"1415732946\"]\nHello Hard Rock planners! We recently shot a fabulous [url=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/destination-wedding-hard-rock-riviera-maya-ss-09182014\/\"]wedding at Hard Rock Riviera Maya[\/url], it really is a fantastic venue and we are looking forward to many more rock n roll brides and grooms. The resort is chic and hip and the wedding coordination team does a bang up job. Here&#039;s a taste of the venue:\n \n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79018-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/\"][img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_16186.jpg[\/img][\/url]\n \n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79019-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/\"][img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_134259.jpg[\/img][\/url]\n \n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79020-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/\"][img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_73209.jpg[\/img][\/url]\n \n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79021-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/\"][img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_176575.jpg[\/img][\/url]\n \n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79022-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/\"][img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_32581.jpg[\/img][\/url]\n \n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79023-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/\"][img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_123549.jpg[\/img][\/url]\n \n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79024-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/\"][img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_35171.jpg[\/img][\/url]\n \n \n \nLet us know how the planning is going and if we can be of any assistance! Rock on chicas.\n[\/quote]Hi thanks for posting these pictures. They look great. It&#039;s hard to find many photos of weddings that have been taken here. \n\nYou are not the preferred vendor for this hotel though are you?","Attachments":[],"Id":1878845,"PostDate":1416579993,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Matt Adcock, on 11 November 2014 - 11:09 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hello Hard Rock planners! We recently shot a fabulous <a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/destination-wedding-hard-rock-riviera-maya-ss-09182014\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>wedding at Hard Rock Riviera Maya<\/a>, it really is a fantastic venue and we are looking forward to many more rock n roll brides and grooms. The resort is chic and hip and the wedding coordination team does a bang up job. Here's a taste of the venue:<br>\n\u00a0<br><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79018-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_16186.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17897_16186.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><br>\n\u00a0<br><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79019-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_134259.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17897_134259.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><br>\n\u00a0<br><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79020-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_73209.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17897_73209.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><br>\n\u00a0<br><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79021-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_176575.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17897_176575.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><br>\n\u00a0<br><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79022-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_32581.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17897_32581.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><br>\n\u00a0<br><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79023-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_123549.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17897_123549.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><br>\n\u00a0<br><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79024-hard-rock-riviera-maya\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17897\/gallery_207303_17897_35171.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17897_35171.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><br>\n\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nLet us know how the planning is going and if we can be of any assistance! Rock on chicas.<br><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nHi thanks for posting these pictures. They look great. It's hard to find many photos of weddings that have been taken here. <br><br>\nYou are not the preferred vendor for this hotel though are you? \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lizzieh83@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"5.65.218.35","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412706195,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280348.jpg?_r=1428633851","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":112,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"LizzieH","Id":280348,"Name":"LizzieH","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.17.228.244","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77972,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3cbf57fb79c27d014f01583d9191ea9a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;ok our site visits changed we are going December 9th. &amp;nbsp;Super excited and we are staying at the HRH. &amp;nbsp;Since we are staying here if anyone has any questions I can try to find an answer or get a photo or something for you.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Checking out a bunch of other resorts while there also.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879172,"PostDate":1416964744,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>ok our site visits changed we are going December 9th. \u00a0Super excited and we are staying at the HRH. \u00a0Since we are staying here if anyone has any questions I can try to find an answer or get a photo or something for you.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Checking out a bunch of other resorts while there also.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Gian-Luigi & Susan September 13, 2015 Finest Resort <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.finestresorts.com\/special-offers\/?gclid=COnnlrKb_sMCFQeUfgodpEAA-A'>http:\/\/www.finestresorts.com\/special-offers\/?gclid=COnnlrKb_sMCFQeUfgodpEAA-A<\/a>","Email":"susanlaurelli@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"47.17.228.244","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1414858204,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280946.jpg?_r=1435774421","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"SusanMarie813","Id":280946,"Name":"SusanMarie813","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.86.74.91","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77972,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1d13bb078c3373ad012f847106957bf4","RawContent":"[quote name=\"SusanMarie813\" post=\"1879172\" timestamp=\"1416964744\"]\nok our site visits changed we are going December 9th.  Super excited and we are staying at the HRH.  Since we are staying here if anyone has any questions I can try to find an answer or get a photo or something for you.\n\nChecking out a bunch of other resorts while there also.[\/quote]\nI would love to see pictures of the ballroom! I can hardly find anything online ! And, give feedback if you can on food","Attachments":[],"Id":1879527,"PostDate":1417575956,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>SusanMarie813, on 25 November 2014 - 05:19 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>ok our site visits changed we are going December 9th. \u00a0Super excited and we are staying at the HRH. \u00a0Since we are staying here if anyone has any questions I can try to find an answer or get a photo or something for you.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Checking out a bunch of other resorts while there also.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I would love to see pictures of the ballroom! I can hardly find anything online ! And, give feedback if you can on food\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cintronnoelia@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.70.107.97","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410140645,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279729.jpg?_r=1432171478","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Noelia","Id":279729,"Name":"Noelia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.17.228.244","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77972,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"22ca14a63dfb881fd734a5869c96fcdf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I will see what I can do :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879528,"PostDate":1417576301,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I will see what I can do <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Gian-Luigi & Susan September 13, 2015 Finest Resort <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.finestresorts.com\/special-offers\/?gclid=COnnlrKb_sMCFQeUfgodpEAA-A'>http:\/\/www.finestresorts.com\/special-offers\/?gclid=COnnlrKb_sMCFQeUfgodpEAA-A<\/a>","Email":"susanlaurelli@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"47.17.228.244","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1414858204,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280946.jpg?_r=1435774421","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"SusanMar