{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.167.189.243","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77645,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9661f09131b4ae8e500c1efc43baa64d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;so happy i found this thread!&amp;nbsp; We want to do something separate too... we are getting married in costa rica... kids will be there but they are going home with my mom 5 days in... some guests are staying the entire time... so i was thinking we go somewhere else for the second week.&amp;nbsp; Im not sure where or if we should just stay in costa rica for another week?&amp;nbsp; that would probably be the least expensive option rather thatn catching a flight somewhere else...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;nicaragua is very close so that may be an option if we can find some kind of transport...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1865493,"PostDate":1407692258,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>so happy i found this thread!\u00a0 We want to do something separate too... we are getting married in costa rica... kids will be there but they are going home with my mom 5 days in... some guests are staying the entire time... so i was thinking we go somewhere else for the second week.\u00a0 Im not sure where or if we should just stay in costa rica for another week?\u00a0 that would probably be the least expensive option rather thatn catching a flight somewhere else...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>nicaragua is very close so that may be an option if we can find some kind of transport...<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"idawhite@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.167.189.243","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407486227,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279359.jpg?_r=1407595489","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":163,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bkprettygirl","Id":279359,"Name":"bkprettygirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.5.56.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77645,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5b1a17d542f6148f8be5778f00296830","RawContent":"We staying a few days with our guests before the wedding plus the day after then changing resorts for our honeymoon across the bay. Best of both worlds :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1865514,"PostDate":1407708562,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We staying a few days with our guests before the wedding plus the day after then changing resorts for our honeymoon across the bay. Best of both worlds <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"spj.wedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.142.197.104","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1407336954,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279330.jpg?_r=1407431220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"spjwedding","Id":279330,"Name":"spjwedding","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.196.202.228","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77645,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c7e87790c62149f5e7e503620b7b1079","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"bkprettygirl\"] I was thinking about that too, whether or not we should leave to another country completely, that would REALLY give it that honeymoon feel! But I know the easiest and less expensive way to go would be to go to another resort. Either way, as long as you have some alone time with the new hubby it&#039;ll be good!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1865761,"PostDate":1407835271,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279359\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279359-bkprettygirl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">bkprettygirl<\/span><\/a> I was thinking about that too, whether or not we should leave to another country completely, that would REALLY give it that honeymoon feel! But I know the easiest and less expensive way to go would be to go to another resort. Either way, as long as you have some alone time with the new hubby it'll be good!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"limaldo96@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.196.202.228","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406462117,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279182.jpg?_r=1406769983","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":168,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lia33","Id":279182,"Name":"Lia33","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.174.145","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77645,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b008a7330ea65156c420390103d2a777","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We haven&#039;t planned our HM yet, but my sister got married in Mexico last year. The wedding was in Riviera Maya and after a week with their guests they flew to Cabo for a few days and then flew up to California\/Napa Valley for another couple days before heading home to Chicago. The time in Cabo at an all inclusive gave them quiet recovery time where they could relax, and then they got a little sightseeing in at the end.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are getting married in Jamaica, where my fiance is from, so he doesn&#039;t want to honeymoon there. I&#039;d like to at least stay a couple days in an adults-only in Negril though. I&#039;d be fine doing the honeymoon separately at a later date as well. We&#039;ll see!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1865821,"PostDate":1407852076,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We haven't planned our HM yet, but my sister got married in Mexico last year. The wedding was in Riviera Maya and after a week with their guests they flew to Cabo for a few days and then flew up to California\/Napa Valley for another couple days before heading home to Chicago. The time in Cabo at an all inclusive gave them quiet recovery time where they could relax, and then they got a little sightseeing in at the end.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are getting married in Jamaica, where my fiance is from, so he doesn't want to honeymoon there. I'd like to at least stay a couple days in an adults-only in Negril though. I'd be fine doing the honeymoon separately at a later date as well. We'll see!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403101687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":false,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"111.93.186.158","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77645,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"09fd4b56baa191a5083825f15eb3b278","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Here I get good ideas to spend separate time with my fiance which is also important. It will also make bot&lt;span&gt;h be happier if you plan&amp;nbsp;one or two separate activities on your honeymoon.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1866329,"PostDate":1408007876,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Here I get good ideas to spend separate time with my fiance which is also important. It will also make bot<span>h be happier if you plan\u00a0one or two separate activities on your honeymoon.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"skashish033@gmail.com","IpAddress":"111.93.186.158","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407217968,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MillerK","Id":279306,"Name":"MillerK","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77645,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7ee705bf34b41691cd8fd584115afff8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I was planning to do a minimoon to Disneyworld and a big honeymoon up to 6 months after the wedding depending on our schedules, i dont think i could stay another week at a resort as nice as it is&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1866812,"PostDate":1408115865,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I was planning to do a minimoon to Disneyworld and a big honeymoon up to 6 months after the wedding depending on our schedules, i dont think i could stay another week at a resort as nice as it is<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nadia.bozanich@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406722272,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nadiakat17","Id":279229,"Name":"nadiakat17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.193.91.193","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77645,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ddc2f0a491f1914a3eb985b50e1c2e57","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I like the idea of taking a separate honeymoon, at a later date.&amp;nbsp; Give myself time to come down from the wedding and give myself another holiday to look forward to.&amp;nbsp; I couldn&#039;t do two weeks at an all-inclusive.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1867212,"PostDate":1408275829,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I like the idea of taking a separate honeymoon, at a later date.\u00a0 Give myself time to come down from the wedding and give myself another holiday to look forward to.\u00a0 I couldn't do two weeks at an all-inclusive.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"boomer_396@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"67.193.91.193","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1404232553,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Brinley","Id":278775,"Name":"Brinley","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.17.81.153","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77645,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fa34156b35403891f0a9a93d7c713ddb","RawContent":"We will be doing ours a few months later. We will stay with our friends and families for the week, however the day after the wedding we are doing our own thing away from everyone else ( not sure what this will be yet) \n\nWe will then go on our HM somewhere tropical during the cold Alberta winter :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1878293,"PostDate":1415838612,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We will be doing ours a few months later. We will stay with our friends and families for the week, however the day after the wedding we are doing our own thing away from everyone else ( not sure what this will be yet) <br>\nWe will then go on our HM somewhere tropical during the cold Alberta winter <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kcrosby86@msn.com","IpAddress":"142.179.243.111","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1398815231,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Kayla88","Id":277780,"Name":"Kayla88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.213.47.20","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77645,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6321776470395e9ee6de9ae256a0c772","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We are considering having our &#039;honeymoon&#039; 6 months later or maybe having a really awesome trip for our 1 year anniversary. I think waiting a year would make it more special and be a nice way to &amp;nbsp;celebrate! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878660,"PostDate":1416325288,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We are considering having our 'honeymoon' 6 months later or maybe having a really awesome trip for our 1 year anniversary. I think waiting a year would make it more special and be a nice way to \u00a0celebrate! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aricalizx3@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.213.47.20","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415706284,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Jamaica2016","Id":281097,"Name":"Jamaica2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.124.40.102","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77645,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9e28c61d02b48be1d4efca1f4d0fda0e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Going to another resort doesn&#039;t sound like a bad idea at all, and I&#039;m sure your guests would understand you want some alone time. Just make sure you talk with your fiance about this and you both agree with whatever decision you&#039;ll take. Good luck and Congrats :).&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879948,"PostDate":1418048704,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Going to another resort doesn't sound like a bad idea at all, and I'm sure your guests would understand you want some alone time. Just make sure you talk with your fiance about this and you both agree with whatever decision you'll take. Good luck and Congrats <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"blushingbride1988@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.124.40.102","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1416236693,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"blushingbride19","Id":281186,"Name":"blushingbride19","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":27,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
